# The bus that brings a new office its first staffer. Five tiles long, driven
# along the street by the floor during the first-run reveal. closed-0 and
# closed-1 turn the wheels; open-0 has the door open at the stop.
sprite street-bus
size 80 40
layer object
footprint 5 1
origin 0 24

frame closed-0
